<title>POLAND: GRAJEWO JULY NET RISES TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>GRAJEWO JULY NET RISES TO PLN 3.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.64 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.02 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.07 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Sales		   16.53 vs  11.78</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    10.89 vs   9.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	18.67 vs  15.48</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.99 vs  17.19</p>
<p> Sales		  150.33 vs 123.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chipboard is Zaklady Plyt</p>
<p>Wiorowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
